From b46c4e248c7d81a4aeac22d730db536d517293e3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: aythapar <aythapar@expediagroup.com>
Date: Mon, 11 May 2026 18:47:51 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 03/17] fix: import shared design data, fix nested anchor, add
 404 route, fix pagination

- Replace local designImages/designNames/designTags/descriptions/details
  constants in App.js with imports from src/data/designs.js
- Remove preloadImages useEffect from HomePage (native loading="eager" handles this)
- Fix React.useState calls to use destructured useState
- Fix nested <Link><Button href=...> anti-pattern with a single <Link>
- Fix asymmetric pagination: Next button always rendered, disabled on last page
- Replace hardcoded trending IDs with TRENDING_IDS.includes()
- Replace TOTAL_DESIGNS magic number with imported constant
- Add NotFoundPage component and <Route path="*"> catch-all route
- Fix zoom modal label: remove misleading 'Scroll to zoom' text
- Add jest moduleNameMapper + TextEncoder polyfill for react-router-dom v7 compat

